{
  "content": "<h1><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Account\">Account</span> &mdash; <span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"FixedAssetsAccumulatedDepreciation\">Fixed assets, accumulated depreciation</span></h1><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account AccumulatedDepreciation Assets Code Count Depreciation Fixed_asset FixedAsset FixedAssets FixedAssetsAccumulatedDepreciation Is Name On Rename To ToDate\">This form allows to rename built-in <code>Fixed assets, accumulated depreciation</code> account.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Accounts AccumulatedDepreciation Assets ChartOfAccounts Code Count Depreciation Edit Fixed_asset FixedAsset FixedAssets FixedAssetsAccumulatedDepreciation Is On Settings To ToDate\">To access this form, go to <code>Settings</code>, then <code>Chart of Accounts</code>, then click <code>Edit</code> button for <code>Fixed assets, accumulated depreciation</code> account.</p><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Contains On\">The form contains the following fields:</p><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Name\">Name</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account AccumulatedDepreciation Assets Code Count Depreciation Fixed_asset FixedAsset FixedAssets FixedAssetsAccumulatedDepreciation Is Name On Rename\">Name of account. The default name is <code>Fixed assets, accumulated depreciation</code> but it can be renamed.</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Code\">Code</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Code Count\">Enter code of the account if desired</p></div></details><details><summary><span translate=\"true\" keyword=\"Group\">Group</span></summary><div><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Account Balance BalanceSheet Code Count Group Is On Select Sent\">Select group on <code>Balance Sheet</code> under which this account should be presented.</p></div></details><p translate=\"true\" keywords=\"Code Date On To ToDate Update\">Click <code>Update</code> button 